//.OVERTAKE AI MOD //////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

// NOTE: These values are used DIRECTLY to determine the extent of blocking in overtake mode. 1.0 is standard - 0.5 is recommended for weaker blocking.
//			Values outside of the range 0.0f to 1.0f are NOT recommended, and less than 0.0f will invert the effect (i.e. they will avoid you).

